">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;mso-line-height-alt:25.5px;letter-spacing:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 17px;\">On Sept. 19, <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47512450.23539/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL21lZGlhLXRyZW5kcy1leGVjdXRpdmU_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1zYWlsdGhydSZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsX21hcmtldGluZyZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bXRlX2FjcXVpc2l0aW9uJnV0bV9jb250ZW50PUFJKzA5MTYyNg/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aG7c388d06\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #0068a5;\" rel=\"noopener\">Media Trends Executive members</a> will receive the first installment of a two-part deep dive examining how publishers, AI companies and Hollywood are beginning to answer these questions.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;mso-line-height-alt:18px;letter-spacing:normal\">\r\n&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;mso-line-height-alt:25.5px;letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 17px;\">What to watch:</span></p><ul style=\"line-height:1.5;mso-line-height-alt:25.5px;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:17px\"><li aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 17px;\"><strong>Copyright law meets borderless technology.</strong> Models can train on content legally in one country and operate in another, putting decades of copyright and fair-use precedent to the test.</span></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><strong style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\nNew payment models are emerging</strong><span style=\"word-break: break-word; background-color: transparent;\">. Publishers and AI companies are experimenting with retrieval-based agreements that could compensate content owners based on actual usage.</span></strong></li><li aria-level=\"1\"><strong style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\nHollywood could set an important precedent</strong><span style=\"word-break: break-word; background-color: transparent;\">. Studio deals are beginning to define how companies can adopt AI while protecting valuable creative IP.&nbsp;</span></strong></li></ul><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;mso-line-height-alt:25.5px;letter-spacing:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 17px;\">For anyone tracking where AI regulation, business models and intellectual property go next, media offers an early look at the rules taking shape.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;mso-line-height-alt:18px;letter-spacing:normal\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;mso-line-height-alt:25.5px;letter-spacing:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 17px;\"><strong><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47512450.23539/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL21lZGlhLXRyZW5kcy1leGVjdXRpdmU_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1zYWlsdGhydSZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsX21hcmtldGluZyZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bXRlX2FjcXVpc2l0aW9uJnV0bV9jb250ZW50PUFJKzA5MTYyNg/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aH7c388d06\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #0068a5;\" rel=\"noopener\">Become a Media Trends Executive member</a></strong> to get the full deep dive on Sept. 19, plus part two of our AI series in October.</span></p></div></div></td></tr></table><table class=\"button_block block-2\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" \r\nstyle=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tr><td class=\"pad\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47512450.23539/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL21lZGlhLXRyZW5kcy1leGVjdXRpdmU_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1zYWlsdGhydSZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsX21hcmtldGluZyZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bXRlX2FjcXVpc2l0aW9uJnV0bV9jb250ZW50PUFJKzA5MTYyNg/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aI7c388d06\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;\"><!--[if mso]>\r\n<v:roundrect xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" xmlns:w=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word\"  href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47512450.23539/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL21lZGlhLXRyZW5kcy1leGVjdXRpdmU_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1zYWlsdGhydSZ1dG1fbWVka